# NOTE: what SHIPS on purpose:
#   - data/sample/            (synthetic bracket, lets you run the pipeline immediately)
#   - runs/**/fused.jpg       (~5MB each, one per experiment — visual evidence)
#   - runs/**/*.json          (all metrics & timing, every number in reports/ is here)
#   - runs/m4_kalantari/*.jpg (per-scene fused vs GT comparison, 13MB total)
#   - runs/m2_alignment/*.jpg (edge-overlay alignment verification figures)
# Kalantari test set (575MB): download from
#   https://cseweb.ucsd.edu/~viscomp/projects/SIG17HDR/PaperData/SIGGRAPH17_HDR_Testset.zip
#   unzip to data/external/SIG17/ then run scripts/eval_kalantari.py
